:answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127911/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "7b561743-8705-5b8a-8882-eca15c6a78a9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127911/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "29ec928d-4fed-511e-98bf-bc72adf8d237" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127911/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "3c2ccf46-b6bf-5c86-a235-83216f4e9d24" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127911/selection/33a3f214ac39c1120abfe6bc86b7e4cdeeecfe239fa5c065011274e009276610" :answer/id #uuid "8a9c6dcb-f573-5d83-9ff7-531ac1aeb53b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{11}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127911/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a1b427c8-4111-57d9-a559-b96d86abedcb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-127911/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-127911/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" "q-127911/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" "q-127911/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" "q-127911/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" "q-127911/selection/33a3f214ac39c1120abfe6bc86b7e4cdeeecfe239fa5c065011274e009276610"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-127911" :question/id #uuid "2106ae49-d1a1-5883-81b7-3f9a97f85eb1" :question/math-academy-id "q-127911" :question/problem "A nonzero vector $⟨a,\\,0,\\,c⟩$ is parallel to the plane $r\\cdot ⟨-1,2,2⟩=\\sqrt{11}.$ What is the value of $\\frac{a}{c}?$" :question/worked-solution "We need a vector $v=⟨{t}_{1},{t}_{2},{t}_{3}⟩$ that is parallel to the given plane. \n\nFrom the equation $r\\cdot ⟨-1,2,2⟩=\\sqrt{11}$ of the plane, we get the normal vector $n=⟨-1,2,2⟩.$ So, $v⊥n$ and we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ ⟨{t}_{1},{t}_{2},{t}_{3}⟩\\cdot ⟨-1,2,2⟩ & =0 \\\\ -{t}_{1}+2{t}_{2}+2{t}_{3} & =0 \\\\ {t}_{1} & =2{t}_{2}+2{t}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we obtain \n\n$$\nv=⟨2{t}_{2}+2{t}_{3},\\,{t}_{2},\\,{t}_{3}⟩,\n$$\n\nwhere ${t}_{2},{t}_{3}\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$ \n\nWe are told that the second component of $v$ equals $0.$ So, we must set ${t}_{2}=0.$ \n\nSince $v$ is nonzero, we can pick any ${t}_{3}\\ne 0.$ For example, setting ${t}_{3}=1$, we get\n\n$$\nv=⟨2,\\,0,\\,1⟩.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\frac{a}{c}=2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-127911/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b0d93156-f9be-5e6e-976a-bef30dc892ee"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-127911"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-70822/selection/b01ba7e917b2f2dc3ff90ccb2c435764c9ebef2dea263cc318e0c231eb7eeb1d" :answer/id #uuid "e525008f-72fa-52f9-ab3e-24568668c21a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70822/selection/edc901e84f0cdd5174afd49105ac3883566ea0e1e057217fb66083a56cc119ba" :answer/id #uuid "88a8d49c-f376-54a0-900f-a6cde2b48d0e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70822/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "4fb71b55-877c-5b65-828b-61a62605d82a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70822/selection/c7e2c99672184a6ffc5fe21255ac37862a4c27e4b225c7b645ba47d8f3c76eda" :answer/id #uuid "0d12685e-070c-5e87-80ec-f550d4b1492e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70822/selection/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" :answer/id #uuid "3d93d805-9f4d-5e11-b71e-dbdd1ffa2381" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70822/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "9e377c1a-e345-5529-a86c-041ad412386c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-70822/selection/edc901e84f0cdd5174afd49105ac3883566ea0e1e057217fb66083a56cc119ba" :answer-field/choices ["q-70822/selection/b01ba7e917b2f2dc3ff90ccb2c435764c9ebef2dea263cc318e0c231eb7eeb1d" "q-70822/selection/edc901e84f0cdd5174afd49105ac3883566ea0e1e057217fb66083a56cc119ba" "q-70822/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" "q-70822/selection/c7e2c99672184a6ffc5fe21255ac37862a4c27e4b225c7b645ba47d8f3c76eda" "q-70822/selection/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-70822" :question/id #uuid "df678eb7-55a1-58ab-b1a0-68980ffc732f" :question/math-academy-id "q-70822" :question/problem "A nonzero vector $⟨a,\\,b,\\,0⟩$ is parallel to the plane $r\\cdot ⟨-5,-1,4⟩=6.$ What is the value of $\\frac{a}{b}?$" :question/worked-solution "We need a vector $v=⟨{t}_{1},{t}_{2},{t}_{3}⟩$ that is parallel to the given plane. \n\nFrom the equation $r\\cdot ⟨-5,-1,4⟩=6$ of the plane, we get the normal vector $n=⟨-5,-1,4⟩.$ So, $v⊥n$ and we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ ⟨{t}_{1},{t}_{2},{t}_{3}⟩\\cdot ⟨-5,-1,4⟩ & =0 \\\\ -5{t}_{1}-{t}_{2}+4{t}_{3} & =0 \\\\ {t}_{2} & =-5{t}_{1}+4{t}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we obtain \n\n$$\nv=⟨{t}_{1},-5{t}_{1}+4{t}_{3},{t}_{3}⟩,\n$$\n\nwhere ${t}_{1},{t}_{3}\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$ \n\nWe are told that the third component of $v$ equals $0.$ So, we must set ${t}_{3}=0.$ \n\nSince $v$ is nonzero, we can pick any ${t}_{1}\\ne 0.$ For example, setting ${t}_{1}=1$, we get\n\n$$\nv=⟨1,\\,-5,\\,0⟩.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\frac{a}{b}=-\\frac{1}{5}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-70822/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b0d93156-f9be-5e6e-976a-bef30dc892ee"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-70822"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-33313/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer/id #uuid "b6d88325-377d-5cce-8511-51495605e5ac" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-33313/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" :answer/id #uuid "3480cce1-a45e-5d9a-ae8d-ec998718688f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-33313/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "8390b68c-d721-5aa7-a417-f8f298695617" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-33313/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "385cc335-3ceb-5153-831b-8df058a3da36" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-33313/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "8326e5ea-b254-5896-81e0-ba5084f3d56a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-33313/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "eca7ee86-582e-5def-9aa5-1fe4aee637d4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-33313/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" :answer-field/choices ["q-33313/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" "q-33313/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" "q-33313/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" "q-33313/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" "q-33313/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-33313" :question/id #uuid "1f6dc541-437c-58b0-a5ee-063fc6840b9a" :question/math-academy-id "q-33313" :question/problem "A nonzero vector $⟨a,\\,0,\\,c⟩$ is parallel to the plane $r\\cdot ⟨4,0,2⟩=16.$ What is the value of $\\frac{a}{c}?$" :question/worked-solution "We need a vector $v=⟨{t}_{1},{t}_{2},{t}_{3}⟩$ that is parallel to the given plane. \n\nFrom the equation $r\\cdot ⟨4,0,2⟩=16$ of the plane, we get the normal vector $n=⟨4,0,2⟩.$ So, $v⊥n$ and we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ ⟨{t}_{1},{t}_{2},{t}_{3}⟩\\cdot ⟨4,0,2⟩ & =0 \\\\ 4{t}_{1}+2{t}_{3} & =0 \\\\ 2{t}_{3} & =-4{t}_{1} \\\\ {t}_{3} & =-2{t}_{1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we obtain \n\n$$\nv=⟨{t}_{1},\\,{t}_{2},\\,-2{t}_{1}⟩,\n$$\n\nwhere ${t}_{1},{t}_{2}\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$ \n\nWe are told that the second component of $v$ equals $0.$ So, we must set ${t}_{2}=0.$ \n\nSince $v$ is nonzero, we can pick any ${t}_{1}\\ne 0.$ For example, setting ${t}_{1}=1$, we get\n\n$$\nv=⟨1,\\,0,\\,-2⟩.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\frac{a}{c}=-\\frac{1}{2}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-33313/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b0d93156-f9be-5e6e-976a-bef30dc892ee"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-33313"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-4935"] :question/worked-solution "Note that the position vector of $Q$ is $\\mathbf{q}=\\langle \\sqrt{2},0,-5 \\rangle.$ Converting the parametric equations of the line to vector form, we get\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14083941/assets/3c1e2e4034bcbc860f548935ca7305bc8f141c56ba14f821fd1aa6cb2b53f8d9.png)\n\nThe direction vector of the line is $\\mathbf{v}=\\langle  0 , \\sqrt{3} , -1\\rangle,$ so a normal vector to the plane is \n\n$$\n\\mathbf{n}=\\mathbf{v}=\\langle  0 , \\sqrt{3} , -1 \\rangle.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the plane is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-q)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n-q\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =q\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨0,\\sqrt{3},-1⟩ & =⟨\\sqrt{2},0,-5⟩\\cdot ⟨0,\\sqrt{3},-1⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨0,\\sqrt{3},-1⟩ & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]}]
